description "Vossk

A retired bounty hunter with deep respect for the hunt.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Tracks/drains on hit
-- 10% faster RoF
- Vossk's Vibroknuckles
-- Dual Style Saber
-- No Blaster Defense/Deflect
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Cripples/Pulses/Tracks/Poisons
- Vossk's Blaster Rifle
-- EE-3 (3)
-- 40% More Damage
-- 20% More Velocity
-- 60% Less RoF
-- Mag Reload
- Unstable Detpacks (3)
-- 100% More Damage, Pulses/Cripples
- Inhibitor Grenades (3)
-- Conc, Pulses/Poisons/Flames
-- Pulls On Hit

^5Powers:
- Hunter Vision (Sense 1)

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Slow Faller
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (2)
- Strength (1)
- Melee Resist
- Healing (3)
-- Regenerate: 5/18s
- Knockdown Roll
- Tracking Beacon
- Acid Blood
- Beskar (1)
- Anti MT (1)
- Experienced Hunter (Miraluka)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Personal Shield ^3[CS4]
- Personalized Wrist Laser ^3[CS3]
-- Pulls On Hit"